{
  "schema": "korpus.doctrine-catalog.v1",
  "compiled_on": "2026-08-08",
  "scope": "Curated source registry for the Ukrainian defence-tech doctrine corpus. Metadata only — no document bytes. Each entry carries the fields import_corpus.py needs (canonical_title, issuer, authority, access_tier, classification, source_uri) plus curation fields the validator enforces. A curator fetches the open documents (a rights decision, GOV-006), runs build_import_manifest.py against the fetched directory, copies these fields in, and ingests. Nothing here is authoritative until a human approves it through the review workflow.",
  "gating_rules": {
    "restricted_never_ingestible": "classification=restricted => ingestible=false. RESTRICTED material (AJP-3.6) is quarantined at the door; cite it only through the open documents that reference it.",
    "commercial_rights_blocked": "rights_status=commercial_restricted => ingestible=false with reason. Rights clearance is a legal/owner decision (GOV-006), not code.",
    "secondary_is_lowest_authority": "source_kind=secondary_analysis => authority=analytical. Analytical carries the lowest authority prior (0.46 in retrieval.py) and is confined out of an answer whenever any higher-authority source is retrieved (_confine_to_top_authority in answer_query.py). It can govern an answer only when nothing more authoritative was found, and it can never overrule or contradict an official source. Note: AuthorityClass.is_normative is true for analytical — only adversary/unknown are non-normative — so the guarantee is 'outranked by official', not 'never used'.",
    "unverified_needs_second_source": "provenance_status!=verified => requires_second_source=true. A mirror or a single-sourced claim enters QUARANTINED and may not be approved until its index number / issuing order is confirmed against a second copy or the primary issuer.",
    "block_reason_required": "ingestible=false => ingest_block_reason is present.",
    "taxonomy_is_the_systems": "authority, classification and access_tier are validated against korpus.domain.models enums, so this catalog cannot drift from what the system accepts."
  },
  "authority_note": "sprotyvg7.com.ua is a volunteer aggregator, not a government portal. Its documents appear to be genuine released AFU publications, but every index number and date is marked unverified until cross-checked. Mirror availability is not evidence of current-edition status.",
